1
00:00:13,013 --> 00:00:16,349
‎15 OKTOBER 1890
‎PERINGKAT KETIGA

2
00:00:17,684 --> 00:00:20,311
<i>‎Para peserta
‎kini memasuki Pergunungan Rocky</i>

3
00:00:20,395 --> 00:00:24,065
<i>‎untuk bergerak menuju ke Cañon City!</i>

4
00:00:24,858 --> 00:00:28,319
<i>‎Halangan terbesar di peringkat ketiga ini</i>

5
00:00:28,403 --> 00:00:31,781
<i>‎ternyata Pergunungan Rocky
‎yang hebat dan agung itu!</i>

6
00:00:31,865 --> 00:00:36,202
‎Kuncinya mungkin terletak
‎pada cara mereka merentasinya!

7
00:00:39,414 --> 00:00:41,374
‎Ini teruk. Benar-benar teruk.

8
00:00:41,458 --> 00:00:42,459
‎KEPUTUSAN PERINGKAT KEDUA

9
00:00:42,542 --> 00:00:47,005
‎Saya pasti akan tamatkan
‎peringkat ketiga di tempat pertama,

10
00:00:47,088 --> 00:00:49,507
‎tapi itu cuma akan beri saya 136 mata.

11
00:00:49,591 --> 00:00:52,802
‎Dio dah kutip 150 mata.

12
00:00:52,886 --> 00:00:55,472
‎Saya masih belum mendahului
‎markah keseluruhan.

13
00:00:55,555 --> 00:00:57,432
<i>‎Lebih buruk lagi…</i>

14
00:00:58,224 --> 00:00:59,809
<i>‎Johnny!</i>

15
00:00:59,893 --> 00:01:02,562
<i>‎Jika dia di tempat pertama,
‎dia akan kutip 180 mata</i>

16
00:01:02,645 --> 00:01:04,773
<i>‎dan mendahului saingan!</i>

17
00:01:04,856 --> 00:01:05,982
{\an8}‎PERINGKAT KETIGA
‎TEMPAT DAH DITENTUKAN

18
00:01:06,066 --> 00:01:07,984
<i>‎Dia dah janji akan tamat di belakang saya.</i>

19
00:01:08,068 --> 00:01:10,570
<i>‎Dia memang penipu!</i>

20
00:01:10,653 --> 00:01:12,697
<i>‎Saya akan ajar dia!</i>

21
00:01:13,782 --> 00:01:16,618
‎Lagipun, Dio dan Sand Man sudah di depan.

22
00:01:16,701 --> 00:01:20,955
‎Mustahil mereka tamatkan
‎peringkat ini tanpa sebarang mata.

23
00:01:21,915 --> 00:01:24,417
‎Tentu bagus jika mereka…

24
00:01:24,501 --> 00:01:26,127
‎Gyro, tengok!

25
00:01:26,211 --> 00:01:27,212
‎Apa?

26
00:01:28,254 --> 00:01:30,256
‎Dio berada di bawah sana.

27
00:01:33,384 --> 00:01:35,178
‎Ada sesuatu yang tak kena.

28
00:01:36,095 --> 00:01:37,639
‎Biar saya lihat.

29
00:01:42,018 --> 00:01:44,813
‎Nampaknya dia tercampak daripada kudanya.

30
00:01:44,896 --> 00:01:47,607
‎Darah mengalir daripada mukanya.

31
00:01:47,690 --> 00:01:51,069
<i>‎Ya! Mungkin ini hari bertuah saya.</i>

32
00:01:51,152 --> 00:01:53,780
‎Dio tercampak daripada kudanya?

33
00:01:53,863 --> 00:01:55,865
‎Susah nak percaya.

34
00:01:56,699 --> 00:01:57,909
‎Dia meringkuk.

35
00:01:59,828 --> 00:02:02,872
‎Nampaknya dia akan tertangguh
‎buat seketika.

36
00:02:02,956 --> 00:02:05,250
‎Dia juga mungkin terpaksa menarik diri.

37
00:02:05,333 --> 00:02:06,793
‎Ayuh kita teruskan, Gyro.

38
00:02:06,876 --> 00:02:10,004
‎Kata-kata itu datang
‎daripada awak, Johnny?

39
00:02:10,088 --> 00:02:13,675
‎Saya memang suka
‎tengok orang lain ditimpa malang,

40
00:02:13,758 --> 00:02:16,970
‎tapi kecederaannya
‎mungkin boleh membawa maut.

41
00:02:17,554 --> 00:02:18,888
‎Ayuh periksa dia.

42
00:02:18,972 --> 00:02:22,308
‎Jangan dekati Diego Brando, Gyro.

43
00:02:22,934 --> 00:02:27,188
‎Awak orang yang berfikiran sempit
‎dan berkira, bukan?

44
00:02:27,272 --> 00:02:29,149
‎Dia tak boleh dipercayai.

45
00:02:29,899 --> 00:02:34,195
‎Dia joki yang hebat di sirkuit perlumbaan
‎yang berprestij di Britain.

46
00:02:34,279 --> 00:02:38,533
‎Namun, dia sanggup buat apa saja
‎demi wang dan kejayaan.

47
00:02:39,159 --> 00:02:41,119
‎Banyak cerita buruk tentang dia.

48
00:02:41,828 --> 00:02:43,955
<i>‎Sebagai contoh, semasa 20 tahun,</i>

49
00:02:44,038 --> 00:02:49,544
<i>‎dia mengahwini wanita
‎yang berusia 83 tahun kerana hartanya.</i>

50
00:02:54,424 --> 00:02:57,218
<i>‎Isterinya mati enam bulan kemudian.</i>

51
00:02:57,969 --> 00:03:00,179
<i>‎Malah ada yang kata, Dio yang bunuh dia.</i>

52
00:03:02,515 --> 00:03:05,310
‎Jadi, maksud awak…

53
00:03:05,894 --> 00:03:09,147
‎Ini mungkin lakonan untuk menipu kita.

54
00:03:09,731 --> 00:03:13,109
‎Dia jenis orang yang sanggup
‎bersekongkol dengan pengganas.

55
00:03:17,196 --> 00:03:21,576
‎Mungkin jika dia kalah
‎kepada seseorang yang tahu semua itu.

56
00:03:21,659 --> 00:03:24,704
‎Tapi, dia di tempat pertama.
‎Kenapa dia nak buat begitu?

57
00:03:25,288 --> 00:03:26,581
‎Saya nak tengok dia.

58
00:03:42,180 --> 00:03:44,182
‎Hei, Dio. Awak okey?

59
00:03:44,265 --> 00:03:46,476
‎Perlukan pasukan penyelamat? Cakaplah.

60
00:03:46,559 --> 00:03:47,852
‎Saya akan tolong panggilkan.

61
00:04:03,451 --> 00:04:05,536
<i>‎Kenapa dengan jari-jarinya?</i>

62
00:04:07,830 --> 00:04:10,208
<i>‎Keruping? Dia sentuh sesuatukah?</i>

63
00:04:12,001 --> 00:04:13,628
‎Jangan campur urusan saya.

64
00:04:13,711 --> 00:04:16,256
‎Jangan buang masa. Pergi.

65
00:04:16,339 --> 00:04:20,260
‎Nanti Dio ini yang akan memotong awak.

66
00:04:22,262 --> 00:04:24,472
‎Nampaknya awak baik-baik saja.

67
00:04:24,555 --> 00:04:25,974
‎Lega mendengarnya!

68
00:04:32,230 --> 00:04:33,439
‎Ayuh pergi, Johnny.

69
00:04:34,941 --> 00:04:36,150
‎Ya.

70
00:05:08,933 --> 00:05:11,811
‎STEEL BALL RUN
‎JOJO’S BIZARRE ADVENTURE

71
00:06:26,511 --> 00:06:30,848
{\an8}‎HARI KELIMA-PERGUNUNGAN ROCKY
‎386 KM DARI MONUMENT VALLEY

72
00:06:31,974 --> 00:06:33,601
{\an8}‎EPISOD SEMBILAN:
‎FRIGHTENING MONSTERS, BAHAGIAN SATU

73
00:06:33,684 --> 00:06:36,979
{\an8}‎Gyro! Kita akan merentasi
‎Pergunungan Rocky dalam masa dua hari!

74
00:06:37,897 --> 00:06:40,441
‎Di sana!
‎Gunung di sebelah kanan laluan ini!

75
00:06:41,067 --> 00:06:43,986
‎Lebih kurang 15 km dari sini.
‎Boleh kita ke sana hari ini?

76
00:06:44,070 --> 00:06:45,154
‎Hari ini tak boleh.

77
00:06:45,738 --> 00:06:48,574
‎Tak lama lagi hari gelap.
‎Kuda-kuda ini perlu berehat.

78
00:06:50,368 --> 00:06:51,661
<i>‎Tidak syak lagi.</i>

79
00:06:51,744 --> 00:06:54,205
<i>‎Anggota seterusnya berada di gunung itu.</i>

80
00:06:55,206 --> 00:06:57,083
<i>‎Saya akan tahu apabila saya di sana!</i>

81
00:06:57,166 --> 00:06:58,209
‎Hei, Johnny.

82
00:06:58,709 --> 00:07:00,628
‎Kuda saya takut.

83
00:07:06,092 --> 00:07:07,510
‎Johnny, tengok!

84
00:07:07,593 --> 00:07:08,970
‎Itu Dio!

85
00:07:11,514 --> 00:07:15,810
‎Dia nampak jauh lebih kuat
‎daripada sebelumnya.

86
00:07:15,893 --> 00:07:17,145
‎Berwaspada, Johnny!

87
00:07:17,228 --> 00:07:20,398
‎Jangan biarkan dia potong kita!

88
00:07:20,982 --> 00:07:23,484
‎Bertenang. Kamu berdua salah faham.

89
00:07:23,568 --> 00:07:26,237
‎Kita dah selesai untuk hari ini.
‎Hari dah nak gelap.

90
00:07:26,863 --> 00:07:28,990
‎Ada desa kecil di depan sana.

91
00:07:29,073 --> 00:07:30,700
‎Kita boleh bermalam di sana.

92
00:07:30,783 --> 00:07:35,413
‎Jangan berkhemah.
‎Ada banyak haiwan liar di sini.

93
00:07:36,664 --> 00:07:40,418
‎Malam kelmarin,
‎saya dikelilingi haiwan liar,

94
00:07:40,501 --> 00:07:43,421
‎kugar dan ular orok-orok.

95
00:07:44,046 --> 00:07:48,676
‎Haiwan-haiwan itu menghalang denai
‎dan saya tak boleh melaluinya.

96
00:07:49,594 --> 00:07:51,888
‎Saya cuba berpusing untuk mengelak,

97
00:07:51,971 --> 00:07:55,892
‎tapi salah seekor beralih ke tepi
‎untuk beri saya laluan.

98
00:07:55,975 --> 00:07:59,061
‎Sungguh sopan haiwan itu.

99
00:07:59,145 --> 00:08:02,356
‎Awak rasa, haiwan mana
‎yang beri saya laluan?

100
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:05,276
‎Kugar atau ular orok-orok?

101
00:08:06,486 --> 00:08:07,737
‎Jawapannya,

102
00:08:07,820 --> 00:08:09,572
‎ular orok-orok!

103
00:08:09,655 --> 00:08:11,866
‎Awak faham tak?

104
00:08:11,949 --> 00:08:14,410
‎Ular-ular orok-orok itu yang ke tepi!

105
00:08:14,494 --> 00:08:15,328
‎Apa?

106
00:08:16,162 --> 00:08:18,623
‎Tolonglah, itu teka-teki.

107
00:08:18,706 --> 00:08:20,124
‎Cuma teka-teki.

108
00:08:20,708 --> 00:08:23,794
‎Kemudian kugar itu
‎boleh makan saya di denai itu!

109
00:08:23,878 --> 00:08:25,379
‎"Kuda pembuka selera!"

110
00:08:25,463 --> 00:08:29,258
‎Kemudian, semua kugar itu berkata,
‎"Kuda pembuka selera!"

111
00:08:30,551 --> 00:08:32,887
‎Saya rasa hebat sekali!

112
00:08:32,970 --> 00:08:36,766
‎Tak pernah rasa sehebat ini! Saya suka!

113
00:08:36,849 --> 00:08:39,310
‎Mungkin kerana terjatuh tadi.

114
00:08:39,393 --> 00:08:42,939
‎Saya terasa sangat ringan.
‎Malang sekali hari dah senja!

115
00:08:43,022 --> 00:08:46,234
‎Diego Brando!
‎Jauhkan diri awak daripada kami!

116
00:08:46,317 --> 00:08:47,610
‎Kami tak nak bersama awak!

117
00:08:47,693 --> 00:08:50,446
‎Johnny Joestar.

118
00:08:50,947 --> 00:08:54,992
‎Awak memacu dengan begitu hebat
‎di peringkat yang pertama dan kedua.

119
00:08:55,076 --> 00:08:58,871
‎Saya dengar awak cedera,
‎tapi awak bangkit semula!

120
00:09:09,173 --> 00:09:10,508
‎Hai!

121
00:09:10,591 --> 00:09:14,011
‎Jika kamu penunggang yang hebat,
‎boleh kamu buat begini?

122
00:09:19,225 --> 00:09:22,228
‎Hei, Johnny. Kenapa dengan dia?

123
00:09:23,688 --> 00:09:26,732
‎Semua joki yang hebat gila macam inikah?

124
00:09:26,816 --> 00:09:28,651
‎Entahlah!

125
00:09:28,734 --> 00:09:30,152
‎Ada sesuatu yang tak kena.

126
00:09:30,236 --> 00:09:32,822
‎Kita nak bermalam dengan diakah?

127
00:09:32,905 --> 00:09:34,740
‎Kalau saya tak mahu pun…

128
00:09:35,533 --> 00:09:38,703
‎Betul juga cakap dia.
‎Tempat ini pun ada serigala.

129
00:09:38,786 --> 00:09:40,496
‎Kita perlu bermalam di desa itu.

130
00:09:40,580 --> 00:09:43,082
‎Betul! Itu lebih selamat.

131
00:09:43,165 --> 00:09:45,126
‎Serigala memburu dalam kawanan!

132
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:47,837
‎Dia boleh dengar perbualan kita.

133
00:09:53,259 --> 00:09:54,677
‎Selamat datang!

134
00:09:57,305 --> 00:09:59,765
‎- Selamat datang!
‎- Kami menanti kedatangan kamu!

135
00:09:59,849 --> 00:10:02,810
‎Mereka tahu tentang perlumbaan ini,

136
00:10:02,893 --> 00:10:05,771
‎walaupun tempat ini terpencil.

137
00:10:06,897 --> 00:10:09,191
‎Mana Dio? Dia dah hilang!

138
00:10:09,275 --> 00:10:10,484
‎Siapa tahu?

139
00:10:10,568 --> 00:10:13,738
‎Mungkin dia sedang menyapa penduduk desa.

140
00:10:14,614 --> 00:10:16,324
‎Saya serius.

141
00:10:16,407 --> 00:10:19,201
‎Saya tak nak tidur dekat dengan dia.

142
00:10:19,285 --> 00:10:23,247
‎Dialah joki yang paling keji.

143
00:10:23,331 --> 00:10:26,292
‎Dia boleh meracun makanan kuda
‎atau mensabotaj peralatan seseorang

144
00:10:26,375 --> 00:10:28,377
‎tanpa berfikir panjang.

145
00:10:29,253 --> 00:10:30,338
‎Saya tahu.

146
00:10:30,421 --> 00:10:34,550
‎Kita akan jaga kuda dan makanannya
‎seperti kita berkhemah.

147
00:10:35,468 --> 00:10:37,011
‎Ada pendiangan di sana.

148
00:10:37,094 --> 00:10:39,930
‎Ayuh sediakan makanan.
‎Saya nak cari kayu api.

149
00:11:05,915 --> 00:11:07,208
<i>‎Dio.</i>

150
00:11:29,522 --> 00:11:31,732
‎Itu kopi.

151
00:11:33,025 --> 00:11:35,111
‎Saya boleh menghidunya.

152
00:11:35,194 --> 00:11:36,779
‎Baunya harum.

153
00:11:37,446 --> 00:11:39,990
‎Awak buat di situ, Dio?

154
00:11:40,074 --> 00:11:42,952
‎- Tiada apa-apa.
‎- "Tiada apa-apa"?

155
00:11:44,036 --> 00:11:46,497
‎Hei! Jangan masuk!

156
00:11:46,580 --> 00:11:51,585
‎Oh. Adakah kerana tadi saya makan batu?

157
00:11:53,129 --> 00:11:57,216
‎Awak tak tahu?
‎Itu untuk penghadaman, En. Joestar.

158
00:11:57,299 --> 00:11:59,885
‎Ia akan hancurkan makanan di dalam perut.

159
00:11:59,969 --> 00:12:01,720
‎Itu dipanggil gastrolitos.

160
00:12:01,804 --> 00:12:04,723
‎Kebanyakan pemakan daging buat begitu.

161
00:12:04,807 --> 00:12:09,019
‎Tabiat yang sihat.
‎Saya tiru daripada burung dan buaya.

162
00:12:09,687 --> 00:12:11,981
‎Awak bancuh kopi, bukan?

163
00:12:12,064 --> 00:12:15,067
‎Baunya tak macam Blue Mountain,

164
00:12:15,151 --> 00:12:17,194
‎tapi baunya harum.

165
00:12:17,278 --> 00:12:19,738
‎Boleh saya minum secawan?

166
00:12:19,822 --> 00:12:21,991
‎Bagaimana keadaan awak selepas jatuh tadi?

167
00:12:22,074 --> 00:12:24,160
‎Awak nampak cedera teruk tadi.

168
00:12:24,243 --> 00:12:26,662
‎Saya rasa hebat.

169
00:12:26,745 --> 00:12:28,205
‎Saya cukup sihat.

170
00:12:28,289 --> 00:12:30,082
‎Kenapa awak pakai sarung tangan?

171
00:12:30,166 --> 00:12:33,085
‎Malam sangat sejuk
‎ketika Oktober di Rockies.

172
00:12:33,169 --> 00:12:35,129
‎Saya membukanya untuk basuh tangan.

173
00:12:35,713 --> 00:12:37,840
‎Boleh beri kopi itu sekarang? Ayuhlah.

174
00:12:38,424 --> 00:12:41,927
‎Saya tak nak mengembara
‎dengan awak. Harap awak faham.

175
00:12:42,928 --> 00:12:46,807
‎Ia di depan awak. Minum saja,
‎kemudian cari rumah kosong lain.

176
00:12:54,231 --> 00:12:56,901
‎Boleh saya tanya sesuatu?

177
00:12:56,984 --> 00:12:59,528
‎Mana satu yang saya patut minum?

178
00:13:00,112 --> 00:13:02,823
‎Apa maksud awak?
‎Cuma ada satu cawan di situ.

179
00:13:03,574 --> 00:13:06,410
‎Dio, awak tak nampakkah?

180
00:13:06,494 --> 00:13:07,745
‎Selainnya makanan dalam tin.

181
00:13:08,454 --> 00:13:09,872
‎Tak nampak?

182
00:13:10,748 --> 00:13:12,291
‎Jangan hina saya!

183
00:13:13,125 --> 00:13:15,419
‎Saya boleh melihat.

184
00:13:15,503 --> 00:13:17,838
‎Mata dan badan saya
‎dalam keadaan yang baik.

185
00:13:17,922 --> 00:13:20,257
‎Penglihatan saya lebih baik
‎pada waktu malam.

186
00:13:20,341 --> 00:13:22,510
‎Jadi, yang mana satu?

187
00:13:23,802 --> 00:13:25,179
‎Mana satu?

188
00:13:26,597 --> 00:13:30,226
‎Hei! Saya dah kata,
‎cuma ada satu cawan di situ!

189
00:13:34,730 --> 00:13:35,940
‎Sungguh aneh.

190
00:13:42,112 --> 00:13:45,324
‎Apa itu? Gigi?

191
00:13:45,407 --> 00:13:48,035
<i>‎Apa sebenarnya dia?</i>

192
00:13:48,118 --> 00:13:50,037
<i>‎Ada apa di sebalik bebat itu?</i>

193
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:52,581
<i>‎Itu mulut!</i>

194
00:13:52,665 --> 00:13:54,250
<i>‎Ia sampai ke telinganya!</i>

195
00:13:54,333 --> 00:13:56,502
<i>‎Mulut itu seperti…</i>

196
00:13:56,585 --> 00:13:58,420
‎Awak buat apa, Johnny?

197
00:13:59,338 --> 00:14:01,924
‎Banyaknya lalat.

198
00:14:02,007 --> 00:14:03,717
‎Ia masuk melalui tingkap.

199
00:14:04,760 --> 00:14:06,136
‎Tutup tingkap itu.

200
00:14:15,145 --> 00:14:18,065
‎Johnny! Tutup tingkap itu sekarang!

201
00:14:18,148 --> 00:14:21,026
‎Lupakan lalat itu! Awak tak perasankah?

202
00:14:21,110 --> 00:14:23,237
‎Ada sesuatu dekat sini!

203
00:14:24,446 --> 00:14:25,865
‎Bangkai beruang!

204
00:14:25,948 --> 00:14:27,491
‎Ada sesuatu yang memakannya!

205
00:14:27,575 --> 00:14:30,077
‎Ini bukan angkara manusia!

206
00:14:35,833 --> 00:14:37,209
‎Dio!

207
00:14:44,049 --> 00:14:46,051
‎Apa sebenarnya dia?

208
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:49,096
‎Dia dah bertukar!

209
00:14:49,179 --> 00:14:52,099
‎Dio pengguna Stand!

210
00:14:56,562 --> 00:14:59,440
‎Gyro!

211
00:15:06,864 --> 00:15:08,198
<i>‎Tusk!</i>

212
00:15:10,367 --> 00:15:11,368
<i>‎Dia dapat elak?</i>

213
00:15:17,458 --> 00:15:21,587
‎Dio musuh! Dia memang bersama
‎pengganas-pengganas itu!

214
00:15:31,430 --> 00:15:34,975
‎Amboi. Tajamnya penglihatan.

215
00:15:35,601 --> 00:15:38,270
‎Dari jarak sedekat ini,

216
00:15:38,354 --> 00:15:40,981
‎awak mengelak dengan mudah.

217
00:15:51,700 --> 00:15:54,745
‎Gyro! Di atas awak!

218
00:15:59,416 --> 00:16:01,460
‎Adakah tujuan awak

219
00:16:01,543 --> 00:16:03,837
‎mencari anggota mayat yang seterusnya

220
00:16:03,921 --> 00:16:07,091
‎atau awak nak bunuh kami
‎dan ambil anggota badan kami?

221
00:16:07,174 --> 00:16:09,551
‎Tindak balas awak terlalu pantas.

222
00:16:09,635 --> 00:16:12,805
‎Tapi jika sesuatu bergerak perlahan,

223
00:16:12,888 --> 00:16:15,766
‎awak tak rasa awak perlu mengelak.

224
00:16:27,569 --> 00:16:30,614
‎Saya masukkan Steel Ball saya
‎ke dalam tin itu.

225
00:16:30,698 --> 00:16:33,951
‎Bagaimana saya masukkan ia
‎melalui logam? Itu rahsia.

226
00:16:38,998 --> 00:16:39,999
‎Gyro!

227
00:16:41,750 --> 00:16:44,962
‎Nampaknya ia tak begitu memberi kesan.

228
00:16:45,045 --> 00:16:46,672
‎Johnny, ayuh keluar dari sini!

229
00:16:47,756 --> 00:16:50,426
‎Keluar sekarang!

230
00:16:55,973 --> 00:16:57,891
‎Apa sebenarnya dia?

231
00:16:57,975 --> 00:16:59,601
‎Kebolehan Stand seperti ini!

232
00:16:59,685 --> 00:17:01,729
‎Ini jenis kelebihan apa?

233
00:17:01,812 --> 00:17:03,814
‎Itu dinosaur, Johnny!

234
00:17:03,897 --> 00:17:07,901
‎Dio seperti mendapatkan kuasa
‎daripada dinosaur.

235
00:17:07,985 --> 00:17:10,696
‎Dinosaur? Dinosaur apa?

236
00:17:10,779 --> 00:17:11,905
‎Awak tak tahu?

237
00:17:11,989 --> 00:17:15,993
‎Ia makhluk yang besar!
‎Lebih besar daripada gajah Afrika!

238
00:17:16,076 --> 00:17:20,706
‎Saintis bernama Owen
‎yang mencipta istilah "dinosaur."

239
00:17:21,665 --> 00:17:23,333
‎Tapi yang ini lebih kecil.

240
00:17:23,417 --> 00:17:25,002
‎Lupakan saja!

241
00:17:25,085 --> 00:17:29,089
‎Apa-apa pun, dinosaur hidup di Bumi
‎lama sebelum manusia!

242
00:17:29,173 --> 00:17:32,718
‎Kenapa Dio dapat kuasa
‎daripada makhluk purba?

243
00:17:32,801 --> 00:17:35,220
‎Mungkin ia ada kaitan dengan fosil.

244
00:17:35,304 --> 00:17:39,141
‎Sejak ia ditemukan di cenuram Colorado,

245
00:17:39,224 --> 00:17:41,602
‎banyak fosil muncul di seluruh Rockies!

246
00:18:09,004 --> 00:18:11,715
‎Tak guna! Pintu ini tak mampu menahan!

247
00:18:11,799 --> 00:18:13,383
‎Kita perlu menuruni cenuram!

248
00:18:13,467 --> 00:18:15,010
‎Tidak! Saya tak nak pergi!

249
00:18:15,094 --> 00:18:19,056
‎Jika Dio mencari anggota mayat itu,
‎saya perlu bunuh dia!

250
00:18:19,681 --> 00:18:21,475
‎Saya takkan pergi dari sini!

251
00:18:22,017 --> 00:18:24,269
‎Dio tak nampak jika awak berdiri kaku!

252
00:18:24,353 --> 00:18:25,354
‎Apa?

253
00:18:32,444 --> 00:18:35,239
‎Gyro, jangan bergerak langsung.

254
00:18:36,490 --> 00:18:39,701
‎Entah kenapa, Dio cuma nampak
‎benda yang bergerak.

255
00:18:39,785 --> 00:18:41,870
‎Mungkin itu sifat dinosaur.

256
00:18:52,965 --> 00:18:55,217
‎Jangan bergerak, walaupun berkelip.

257
00:18:56,009 --> 00:18:58,762
‎Saya yakin. Ia berlaku sebelum ini.

258
00:18:59,388 --> 00:19:01,682
‎Dia tak nampak kopi tadi.

259
00:19:05,811 --> 00:19:07,396
‎Bagus!

260
00:19:07,479 --> 00:19:09,940
‎Dia sangka kita menuruni cenuram itu.

261
00:19:19,158 --> 00:19:21,535
‎Hei, dia nampak kitakah?

262
00:19:21,618 --> 00:19:22,786
‎Dia berpatah balik!

263
00:19:30,002 --> 00:19:31,503
‎Bertenang, Gyro.

264
00:19:31,587 --> 00:19:33,213
‎Dia tak tahu.

265
00:19:33,714 --> 00:19:35,966
‎Dia menghidu-hidu beruang itu saja.

266
00:19:50,314 --> 00:19:51,315
‎Adakah ia berhasil?

267
00:19:51,398 --> 00:19:54,067
‎Ke mana dia pergi? Dia dah pergi?

268
00:19:55,527 --> 00:19:57,696
‎Awak rasa dia dah tak cari kita?

269
00:20:04,661 --> 00:20:07,372
<i>‎Ya! Dia tahu!</i>

270
00:20:07,456 --> 00:20:11,585
<i>‎Dio dah nampak kemampuan
‎Steel Ball itu dalam peringkat pertama!</i>

271
00:20:12,711 --> 00:20:14,254
‎Gyro, ini tak bagus!

272
00:20:14,338 --> 00:20:19,301
‎Dia tahu Steel Ball awak yang berputar
‎pasti akan balik kepada awak!

273
00:20:19,384 --> 00:20:21,261
‎Dia tahu di mana ia akan balik!

274
00:20:21,345 --> 00:20:24,765
‎Dia akan ikut Steel Ball itu!

275
00:20:30,854 --> 00:20:33,148
‎Tidak!

276
00:20:44,451 --> 00:20:46,245
‎Bertenang, Johnny.

277
00:20:46,328 --> 00:20:51,124
‎Steel Ball itu balik semula
‎dan ratakan kaki saya dengan putarannya.

278
00:20:52,501 --> 00:20:57,547
‎Nampaknya Dio sangka
‎kita pergi ke sebalik dinding itu.

279
00:21:01,009 --> 00:21:03,553
‎Ya! Dia menuruni cenuram!

280
00:21:05,472 --> 00:21:08,934
‎Johnny, tentang huruf-huruf
‎pada lengan kiri awak itu,

281
00:21:09,017 --> 00:21:10,727
‎saya baru menyedari sesuatu.

282
00:21:11,645 --> 00:21:14,106
‎Tentang cara ia disusun.

283
00:21:26,785 --> 00:21:27,786
‎Gyro!

284
00:21:27,869 --> 00:21:30,038
‎Ada sesuatu yang tak kena.

285
00:21:34,376 --> 00:21:37,170
‎Awak dengar sesuatu di bawah kita?

286
00:21:37,796 --> 00:21:40,632
‎Ya. Itu bunyi apa?

287
00:21:43,593 --> 00:21:45,262
‎Apa? Apa ini?

288
00:21:50,851 --> 00:21:52,227
‎Apa?

289
00:21:52,894 --> 00:21:56,273
‎Ia juga dah bertukar dan ia masih hidup!

290
00:21:56,356 --> 00:21:59,568
‎Apa sebenarnya kebolehan Dio?

291
00:22:03,822 --> 00:22:05,991
{\an8}‎AKAN BERSAMBUNG

292
00:23:30,909 --> 00:23:35,914
{\an8}‎Terjemahan sari kata oleh Aminuddin Buang

